					<h1>Eze Castle Software</h1>
					
					<H2>Award-winning Technology Solutions.</H2>
<P><A href="/ASSETS/A34D3426EAD746E38AE45CEA634F20E0/" target=_top>Eze Castle Software</A>&nbsp;is one of the industry pioneers in automating the investment cycle. From portfolio management and trading to compliance and operations, we provide the resources and expertise to help you navigate your investment challenges successfully.</P>
<P>Investment technology is increasingly sophisticated and complex, and we can help you simplify and optimize it to make the most of your trading style and investment strategies. Our solutions incorporate a real-time open architecture to support automation from idea generation to settlement—for all major asset classes. </P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P><A href="/ASSETS/A34D3426EAD746E38AE45CEA634F20E0/" target=_top><SPAN style="COLOR: #000066">Eze OMS</SPAN></A><SPAN style="COLOR: #000066">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </SPAN><A href="/ASSETS/82536CBAFE6344B0AC55870B002C02B1/" target=_top><SPAN style="COLOR: #000066">Current Job Openings at Eze Castle Software</SPAN></A><SPAN style="COLOR: #000066">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style="COLOR: #000066"><FONT color=#000000>To learn more about the Eze OMS, please call 646-346-1140 or email us at <A href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#681b09040d1b280d120d0b091b1c040d1b070e1c1f091a0d460b0705"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="1c6f7d70796f5c7966797f7d6f6870796f737a686b7d6e79327f7371">[email&#160;protected]</span></A>.&nbsp;</FONT></SPAN></P>
